# scenes on the Arrange page: a second scene cloned, a mute; while playing a white key waits for the bar (again: now),
# HOME + white key for track 1's end; the song
wait 200
tap HOME
expect page Arrange
expect scene 1
tapkey w1
expect scene 2
wait 40
shot scene2.png
tapkey b0
wait 40
shot scene2_mute.png
tap PLAY
wait 300
tapkey w0
wait 40
expect scene 2
shot scene_cue_bar.png
wait 2500
expect scene 1
tapkey w1
wait 40
expect scene 1
tapkey w1
wait 40
expect scene 2
press HOME
tapkey w0
release HOME
wait 40
expect scene 2
shot scene_cue.png
wait 2500
expect scene 1
tap PLAY
# holding a scene's key asks CLEAR SCENE?; another scene's key, or that key again, is no
key w1 down
wait 1100
expect ask 1
tapkey w0
key w1 up
wait 40
expect ask 0
expect scene 2
key w1 down
wait 1100
expect ask 1
key w1 up
tapkey w1
wait 40
expect ask 0
expect scene 2
turn SELECT 1
expect page Song
tapkey w0
tapkey w1
tapkey w1
wait 40
shot song_slots.png
tap SEL
wait 40
shot song_list.png
tap HOME
tap PLAY
wait 1500
shot song_playing.png
tap PLAY
# Mix: a black key held solos, HOME + black key mutes
tap GLO
key b2 down
wait 100
shot mix_solo.png
key b2 up
press HOME
tapkey b1
release HOME
wait 40
shot mix_mute.png
